2633..2711 Comment "/// A dialogue that hands off: the seat\'s notes sent before the operator takes"
2712..2785 Comment "/// the choice. Its web leaves a prime node: the seat\'s notes precede its"
2786..2863 Comment "/// close and the operator\'s receipt, the operator\'s choice precedes only the"
2864..2934 Comment "/// receipt, and no module of the four joins them — the N-shape, the"
2935..2979 Comment "/// operator\'s receipt and close one factor."
